I'll create a self-contained HTML file that replicates the classic 1978 Taito arcade game "Aster" with full fidelity to the original rules, sprite designs, and mechanics.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Asteroids - 1978 Taito Arcade</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            background: #000;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        }
        .game-container {
            position: relative;
            border: 3px solid #000;
            background: #000;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.3);
        }
        canvas {
            display: block;
            background: #000;
            image-rendering: pixelated;
        }
        .info {
            position: absolute;
            top: 10px;
            left: 10px;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 14px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 5px #0ff;
        }
        .info span {
            color: #0f0;
        }
        .controls {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 10px;
            left: 10px;
            color: #555;
            font-size: 11px;
        }
        .overlay {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
            color: #0f0;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px #0f0;
        }
        .overlay h1 {
            font-size: 36px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
        }
        .overlay p {
            font-size: 16px;
            margin: 5px 0;
        }
        .overlay .highlight {
            color: #fff;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px #fff;
        }
        .hidden {
            display: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="game-container">
        <div id="overlay" class="overlay">
            <h1>ASTEROIDS</h1>
            <p>© 1978 TAIYO</p>
            <p class="highlight">PRESS SPACE TO START</p>
            <p style="font-size:12px; color:#555;">↑↓←→  move | SPACE  fire</p>
        </div>
        <canvas id="gameCanvas" width="800" height="600"></canvas>
        <div class="info" id="info">SCORE: <span id="score">0</span>  HIGH: <span id="highScore">0</span></div>
        <div class="controls">LIVES: <span id="lives">3</span></div>
    </div>
